          <div>
            <h2>Hello — I'm Sumit</h2>
            <p class="lead">
              AI student focused on practical machine learning and web development. I build small projects to learn and solve real problems. Fast learner and eager to contribute to innovative teams.
            </p>
            <div class="cta-row">
              <a class="btn-primary" href="#projects">View Projects</a>
              <a class="btn-ghost" href="mailto:your-email@example.com">Email Me</a>
            </div>
            <ul class="quick-info">
              <li><strong>Location:</strong> Dubai, UAE</li>
              <li><strong>Looking for:</strong> Internship / Junior Developer role</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
