    <section id="about" class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">About Me</h2>
        <p>I am currently studying AI and working on small development projects to build practical skills. I enjoy solving problems with code and learning by building. I am looking for an internship to contribute, learn, and grow within a product-driven team.</p>

        <ul class="about-list">
          <li><strong>Education:</strong> HND in Digital Technology & AI (in progress)</li>
          <li><strong>Availability:</strong> Immediate / Part-time internship</li>
          <li><strong>Language:</strong> English, Hindi</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="section alt">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Contact</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">Send me a message — I reply fast.</p>

        <form id="contactForm" class="contact-form" onsubmit="return onContactSubmit(event)">
          <label>
            <span>Name</span>
            <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Your name" required />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Email</span>
            <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="your-email@example.com" required />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Message</span>
            <textarea id="message" placeholder="Write a short message" rows="4" required></textarea>
          </label>
          <div class="form-actions">
            <button class="btn-primary" type="submit">Send Message</button>
            <button class="btn-ghost" type="button" onclick="fillForFounder()">Use message for founder</button>
          </div>
        </form>

        <div id="formResult" class="form-result" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </div>
